29. Media Objects
Media Object — rasm/video va uning yonidagi matnni tartibli joylashtirish uchun ishlatiladi.
<div class="media">

    <div class="media-left">
        <img src="img_avatar1.png"
             class="media-object"
             style="width:60px">
    </div>

    <div class="media-body">
        <h4 class="media-heading">John Doe</h4>
        <p>Bu yerda comment yoziladi.</p>
    </div>

</div>
Bu qanday ishlaydi?
.media
 ├── .media-left
 │    └── rasm
 │
 └── .media-body
      ├── .media-heading
      └── matn
2. Rasmni o‘ngga qo‘yish
<div class="media">

    <div class="media-body">
        <h4 class="media-heading">John Doe</h4>
        <p>Bu yerda comment yoziladi.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="media-right">
        <img src="img_avatar1.png"
             class="media-object"
             style="width:60px">
    </div>

</div>
3. Top / Middle / Bottom

Rasmni matnga nisbatan yuqori, o‘rta yoki pastga joylashtirish mumkin.
<div class="media">
    <div class="media-left media-top">
        <img src="img_avatar1.png"
             class="media-object"
             style="width:60px">
    </div>

    <div class="media-body">
        <h4 class="media-heading">Media Top</h4>
        <p>Bu yerda matn.</p>
    </div>
</div>
