//SELF
Media Objects
→ Rasm/video + matnni yonma-yon tartiblash uchun.

.media
→ asosiy Media Object container

.media-left
→ media chapda

.media-right
→ media o‘ngda

.media-body
→ matn/content qismi

.media-heading
→ heading/title

.media-object
→ rasm yoki media

.media-top
→ yuqoriga

.media-middle
→ o‘rtaga

.media-bottom
→ pastga

Nesting
→ Media Object ichida yana Media Object
